pip install tensorflowjs

tensorflowjs_converter --input_format keras model.h5 browserCompatibleModel/


This creates a model.json and weight files in modelTraining/browserCompatibleModel.

The contents of browserCompatibleModel folder can then be moved to the frontend model folder.

